DECISIONS 213, CODEGEN.md §2.2, §4.4: which values an emit writes depends on its mode, so an emit whose mode check refused (E8009) judges none of them: a Range value is not E8012 there.
-- a/a.canon --
package a

/// A span.
let span: Range = 1..3

emit go { out: "@features/a", package: "a", mode: fast }
-- findings.txt --
error[E8009]  a/a.canon:6:51
  invalid mode fast for emit go: expected one of baked, embedded, data, types

1 error, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
